# Supabase — Curtain Guy only

This repo is bound to **one** Supabase project. Do not touch any other.

## Allowed MCP

- **Only** the MCP server named `supabase-thecurtainguy`
  - Runtime namespace may appear as `project-0-the-curtain-guy-supabase-thecurtainguy`
- Config: `.cursor/mcp.json` → `supabase-thecurtainguy`

## Project identity

- **Project ref:** `xszhnecwhjcywhqjzfit`
- **API URL:** `https://xszhnecwhjcywhqjzfit.supabase.co`

If a tool response points at a different ref or host, **stop** and ask before continuing.

## Forbidden

- Generic Supabase plugin MCP (`plugin-supabase-supabase`, org-level, multi-project pickers)
- Any other Supabase project (including ZATOV / other workspaces)
